<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>JCB EDS Lab &mdash; Material Management</title>
<hta:application id="edslab" applicationname="EDS Lab Material Management"
  border="thin" caption="yes" maximizebutton="yes" minimizebutton="yes"
  scroll="no" singleinstance="no" showintaskbar="yes" contextmenu="yes"
  navigable="yes" innerborder="no" selection="yes" icon="" />
<style>
/* ===================================================================
   JCB EDS Lab — Material Management
   ---------------------------------------------------------------
   WRITTEN FOR THE WINDOWS IE ENGINE THAT RUNS AN .HTA.

   Everything here uses only CSS that MSHTML understands:
     - literal colour values (no var(--x): IE drops those declarations
       entirely, which is what turned the portal into a plain white page)
     - float / inline-block / absolute positioning (no grid, no flexbox)
     - explicit margins for spacing (no gap)
     - explicit top/left/width/height (no inset shorthand)
   Gradients, shadows, rounded corners and transitions are all IE9/IE10+
   and are used freely — every one has a solid colour underneath it so
   the design still holds if a rule is ever ignored.

   Palette      ink on near-black, JCB yellow as the single accent
   #15161a bg     #1d1f24 panel    #24272d panel raised   #111216 sunk
   #31353c line   #3d424a line2    #eae8e3 ink            #a3a8b0 ink2
   #71767e ink3   #f2b01e JCB      #c88f10 JCB dark       #2e2614 JCB wash
   #6c9cc6 steel  #4fae7d ok       #d99b3c warn           #dc7361 stop
=================================================================== */

*{box-sizing:border-box}
html,body{height:100%;margin:0}
body{background:#15161a;color:#eae8e3;
  font-family:"Segoe UI",system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;
  overflow:hidden;-ms-overflow-style:scrollbar}
/* NOT color:inherit on form controls. The IE engine behind an .hta ignores
   inherit for the text colour of inputs and falls back to system black — on
   the dark #111216 field that is black text and a black caret, which is
   exactly why nothing typed into the invoice form could be seen. Every
   control below gets a literal colour instead. */
button,input,select,textarea{font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit}
/* buttons too get a literal colour — the sign-in list's names are plain text
   inside a <button>, and without this they fell back to system black */
button{color:#eae8e3}
a{color:#f2b01e;text-decoration:none}

/* utility ---------------------------------------------------------- */
.cf:after,.brand:after,.ph:after,.bar:after,.f2:after,.f3:after,.stats:after,
.pick button:after,.role:after,.jc-hd:after,.jc-actions:after,.idrow:after{
  content:"";display:block;clear:both;height:0;overflow:hidden}
.mono{font-family:Consolas,"Cascadia Mono","DejaVu Sans Mono",monospace}
.num{font-family:Consolas,"Cascadia Mono","DejaVu Sans Mono",monospace;text-align:right}
.muted{color:#71767e}
.hz{height:6px;background-color:#f2b01e;
  background-image:repeating-linear-gradient(115deg,#f2b01e 0,#f2b01e 12px,transparent 12px,transparent 24px)}
::-webkit-scrollbar{width:10px;height:10px}
::-webkit-scrollbar-track{background:#111216}
::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:#3d424a;border:2px solid #111216}

/* =========================== LOGIN ================================ */
#login{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;background:#15161a;z-index:50}

#login .art{position:absolute;top:0;left:0;bottom:0;width:55%;
  background-color:#111216;
  background-image:
    radial-gradient(1100px 520px at 12% 8%,#232630 0,rgba(17,18,22,0) 62%),
    repeating-linear-gradient(0deg,rgba(255,255,255,.022) 0,rgba(255,255,255,.022) 1px,transparent 1px,transparent 48px),
    repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,255,255,.022) 0,rgba(255,255,255,.022) 1px,transparent 1px,transparent 48px);
  border-right:3px solid #f2b01e}
#login .artin{position:absolute;left:58px;right:54px;bottom:54px}
#login .art h1{font-family:Bahnschrift,"Archivo Narrow","Segoe UI Semibold","Segoe UI",sans-serif;
  font-weight:700;font-size:50px;line-height:.98;letter-spacing:.01em;margin:0 0 16px;text-transform:uppercase}
#login .art h1 em{color:#f2b01e;font-style:normal;display:block}
#login .art p{max-width:46ch;color:#a3a8b0;margin:0 0 30px;font-size:15px}
#login .stats{border-top:1px solid #31353c;padding-top:20px}
#login .stats div{float:left;margin-right:44px}
#login .stats b{display:block;font-family:Bahnschrift,"Archivo Narrow","Segoe UI",sans-serif;
  font-size:30px;color:#f2b01e;line-height:1}
#login .stats span{font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:#71767e;text-transform:uppercase}

#login .form{position:absolute;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;width:45%;padding:46px 50px;overflow:auto}
.brand .mk{float:left;width:38px;height:38px;background:#f2b01e;color:#1a1206;
  font-family:Bahnschrift,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:17px;
  text-align:center;line-height:38px}
.brand .mk+div{margin-left:50px}
.brand .t1{font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.17em;color:#71767e;text-transform:uppercase}
.brand .t2{font-family:Bahnschrift,"Archivo Narrow","Segoe UI",sans-serif;font-size:19px;letter-spacing:.01em}
.lbl{font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;
  color:#71767e;display:block;margin:22px 0 9px}

/* role cards — three ways in, no roster on the wall ----------------- */
.role{display:block;width:100%;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;margin:0 0 11px;padding:16px 18px;
  background-color:#1d1f24;background-image:linear-gradient(180deg,#212429 0,#1b1d22 100%);
  border:1px solid #31353c;border-left:3px solid #3d424a}
.role:hover{border-color:#c88f10;border-left-color:#f2b01e;
  background-image:linear-gradient(180deg,#262a31 0,#1e2026 100%)}
.role .ic{float:left;width:42px;height:42px;background:#24272d;border:1px solid #3d424a;
  text-align:center;line-height:40px}
.role .ic svg{vertical-align:middle}
/* block beside a float: overflow:hidden makes it form its own box so wrapped
   lines stay aligned instead of sliding under the icon */
.role .rt{display:block;overflow:hidden;padding:0 14px 0 14px}
.role .rt b{display:block;font-family:Bahnschrift,"Archivo Narrow","Segoe UI",sans-serif;
  font-size:16px;letter-spacing:.02em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#eae8e3;margin-bottom:2px}
.role .rt small{display:block;color:#71767e;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.45}
.role .go{float:right;margin-top:10px;font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:18px;color:#3d424a}
.role:hover .go{color:#f2b01e}
.role .cnt{font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:10px;color:#a3a8b0}

/* "who are you" step, only when the Windows user can't be matched --- */
.idrow{margin:0 0 10px}
.idback{background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;color:#71767e;
  font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.08em;padding:0}
.idback:hover{color:#f2b01e}
.pick{margin-top:8px;max-height:46vh;overflow:auto}
.pick button{display:block;width:100%;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;margin-bottom:8px;padding:11px 14px;
  background:#1d1f24;border:1px solid #31353c}
.pick button:hover{border-color:#c88f10;background:#24272d}
.pick button .av{float:left;width:36px;height:36px;background:#24272d;border:1px solid #3d424a;
  color:#f2b01e;font-family:Bahnschrift,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;font-size:14px;text-align:center;line-height:34px}
.pick button .pt{display:block;overflow:hidden;padding:0 12px}
.pick button b{display:block;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;color:#eae8e3}
.pick button small{color:#71767e;font-size:12.5px}
.pick button .go{float:right;margin-top:6px;font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:15px;color:#71767e}
.pick button:hover .go{color:#f2b01e}
.note{border-left:2px solid #6c9cc6;background:#17222c;padding:11px 14px;margin-top:22px;
  font-size:12.5px;color:#a3a8b0}

/* =========================== SHELL ================================ */
#shell{display:none;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%}
#shell.on{display:block}
header{position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:56px;padding:0 16px;
  background-color:#111216;background-image:linear-gradient(180deg,#15171c 0,#0f1014 100%);
  border-bottom:1px solid #31353c}
header .brand{float:left;margin-top:9px}
header .brand .mk{width:36px;height:36px;line-height:36px;font-size:16px}
header .brand .mk+div{margin-left:46px}
.who{float:right;margin:11px 0 0 14px;padding-left:14px;border-left:1px solid #31353c}
.who .av{float:left;width:32px;height:32px;background:#f2b01e;color:#1a1206;
  font-family:Bahnschrift,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;text-align:center;line-height:32px}
.who .av+div{margin-left:42px}
.who b{display:block;font-size:13px;line-height:1.2}
.who span{font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:10px;color:#f2b01e;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase}
.hbtn{float:right;margin:14px 0 0 8px;background:#1d1f24;border:1px solid #31353c;color:#a3a8b0;
  padding:6px 11px;cursor:pointer;font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.06em}
.hbtn:hover{border-color:#c88f10;color:#eae8e3}
.src{float:right;margin:14px 0 0 12px;padding-left:14px;border-left:1px solid #31353c;
  font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:11px;color:#71767e;white-space:nowrap;line-height:26px}
.src .dot{display:inline-block;width:8px;height:8px;background:#4fae7d;margin-right:7px;
  border-radius:50%;vertical-align:middle}
.src.demo .dot{background:#6c9cc6}
.src.bad .dot{background:#dc7361}
.src b{color:#a3a8b0;font-weight:400}
.src .hbtn{float:none;display:inline-block;margin:0 0 0 10px;vertical-align:middle}

nav{position:absolute;top:56px;left:0;bottom:0;width:224px;overflow:auto;
  background:#111216;border-right:1px solid #31353c;padding:12px 0}
nav .grp{font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:.16em;color:#71767e;
  text-transform:uppercase;padding:15px 18px 6px}
nav a{display:block;padding:9px 18px;cursor:pointer;color:#a3a8b0;
  border-left:3px solid transparent;font-size:13.5px}
nav a:hover{background:#1d1f24;color:#eae8e3}
nav a.on{background-color:#1d1f24;background-image:linear-gradient(90deg,#26231a 0,#1d1f24 100%);
  color:#eae8e3;border-left-color:#f2b01e;font-weight:600}
nav a .cnt{float:right;font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:10px;background:#24272d;
  border:1px solid #3d424a;padding:0 6px;color:#a3a8b0}
nav a.on .cnt{background:#2e2614;border-color:#c88f10;color:#f2b01e}

main{position:absolute;top:56px;left:224px;right:0;bottom:0;overflow:auto;padding:22px 26px 60px}
.ph{border-bottom:1px solid #31353c;padding-bottom:12px;margin-bottom:20px}
/* The old layout used a flex spacer (<span class="sp">) to push trailing
   controls to the right. With floats the spacer is meaningless, so it is
   hidden and every element child other than the title floats right instead
   — this keeps all the existing screen code working untouched. */
.ph>*{float:right;margin-left:10px}
.ph>h2,.ph>p{float:none;margin-left:0}
.ph>.sp,header>.sp,.card>h3>.sp{display:none}
.ph h2{float:left;font-family:Bahnschrift,"Archivo Narrow","Segoe UI",sans-serif;font-size:25px;
  margin:0;letter-spacing:.01em;text-transform:uppercase}
.ph p{float:left;margin:8px 0 0 14px;color:#71767e;font-size:13px}

/* =========================== PIECES =============================== */
.tiles{margin-bottom:20px}
.tile{display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:182px;margin:0 10px 10px 0;padding:13px 15px;
  background-color:#1d1f24;background-image:linear-gradient(180deg,#212429 0,#1b1d22 100%);
  border:1px solid #31353c;border-top:2px solid #3d424a}
.tile.a{border-top-color:#f2b01e}
.tile.g{border-top-color:#4fae7d}
.tile.w{border-top-color:#d99b3c}
.tile.r{border-top-color:#dc7361}
.tile.b{border-top-color:#6c9cc6}
.tile dt{font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase;
  color:#71767e;margin-bottom:6px}
.tile dd{margin:0;font-family:Bahnschrift,"Archivo Narrow","Segoe UI",sans-serif;font-size:28px;
  line-height:1;word-wrap:break-word}
.tile dd small{font-family:"Segoe UI",sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#71767e;display:block;
  margin-top:5px;line-height:1.35}

.card{background:#1d1f24;border:1px solid #31353c;margin-bottom:18px}
.card>h3{font-family:Bahnschrift,"Archivo Narrow","Segoe UI",sans-serif;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:.04em;
  text-transform:uppercase;margin:0;padding:11px 15px;border-bottom:1px solid #31353c;
  background-color:#24272d;background-image:linear-gradient(180deg,#282c33 0,#22252b 100%)}
.card>h3>*{float:right;margin-left:10px;font-family:"Segoe UI",sans-serif;text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0}
.cb{padding:15px}
.tw{overflow:auto;max-height:60vh}

table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:13px}
thead th{position:sticky;top:0;background:#24272d;text-align:left;font-family:Consolas,monospace;
  font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:.11em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#a3a8b0;padding:8px 11px;
  border-bottom:1px solid #3d424a;white-space:nowrap;z-index:2}
tbody td{padding:7px 11px;border-bottom:1px solid #31353c;vertical-align:middle}
tbody tr:hover{background:#24272d}
tbody tr.sel{background:#2e2614}
td.mono,th.mono{font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:nowrap}

.pill{display:inline-block;font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:.06em;
  padding:2px 7px;border:1px solid;white-space:nowrap}
.k-ok{background:#15261d;color:#4fae7d;border-color:#4fae7d}
.k-w{background:#2a2214;color:#d99b3c;border-color:#d99b3c}
.k-r{background:#2c1a17;color:#dc7361;border-color:#dc7361}
.k-b{background:#17222c;color:#6c9cc6;border-color:#6c9cc6}
.k-m{background:#24272d;color:#71767e;border-color:#3d424a}
.k-a{background:#2e2614;color:#f2b01e;border-color:#c88f10}

.btn{background-color:#f2b01e;background-image:linear-gradient(180deg,#f7bb35 0,#e5a614 100%);
  color:#1a1206;border:1px solid #c88f10;padding:8px 15px;cursor:pointer;
  font-family:Bahnschrift,"Archivo Narrow","Segoe UI",sans-serif;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.05em;
  text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700}
.btn:hover{background-image:linear-gradient(180deg,#ffc63c 0,#f0b021 100%)}
.btn:disabled{background:#24272d;background-image:none;color:#71767e;border-color:#3d424a;cursor:default}
.btn.sec{background:#1d1f24;background-image:none;color:#a3a8b0;border-color:#3d424a;font-weight:600}
.btn.sec:hover{border-color:#c88f10;color:#f2b01e;background:#24272d}
.btn.sm{padding:4px 10px;font-size:11.5px}
.btn.dg{background:#1d1f24;background-image:none;border-color:#dc7361;color:#dc7361}
.btn.dg:hover{background:#2c1a17}

/* type=password and type=file were never listed here, so the sign-in boxes
   and the file pickers rendered as bare white browser defaults against the
   dark panel. type=date stays in the list only for anything a skill or a
   future screen might add — the portal itself no longer uses it. */
input,select,textarea{color:#eae8e3;background-color:#111216}
input[type=text],input[type=number],input[type=date],input[type=password],
input[type=file],input[type=search],input[type=tel],input[type=email],select,textarea{
  color:#eae8e3;background-color:#111216;border:1px solid #3d424a;padding:8px 10px;width:100%}
input:focus,select:focus,textarea:focus{outline:none;border-color:#f2b01e;color:#ffffff;background-color:#0d0e11}
select option{color:#eae8e3;background-color:#1d1f24}
input[readonly]{color:#a3a8b0}
/* placeholder text: one rule per engine, never grouped — a selector the IE
   engine does not know makes it throw away the ENTIRE rule it sits in */
input:-ms-input-placeholder{color:#71767e}
textarea:-ms-input-placeholder{color:#71767e}
input::placeholder{color:#71767e}
textarea::placeholder{color:#71767e}
textarea{resize:vertical;font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:12.5px}
.fg{margin-bottom:13px}
.fg label{display:block;margin-bottom:4px;font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:9.5px;
  letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#71767e}
.fg label i{color:#dc7361;font-style:normal}
.f2 .fg{float:left;width:48%;margin-right:4%}
.f2 .fg.last,.f2 .fg:last-child{margin-right:0}
.f3 .fg{float:left;width:30.66%;margin-right:4%}
.f3 .fg.last,.f3 .fg:last-child{margin-right:0}
.bar{margin-bottom:14px}
.bar>*{vertical-align:middle;margin:0 10px 8px 0}
.bar input[type=text]{display:inline-block;width:290px}
.bar select{display:inline-block;width:200px}
.bar .btn,.bar label,.bar span{display:inline-block;width:auto}

.meter{height:4px;background:#31353c;width:56px;display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:8px}
.meter i{display:block;height:100%}
.empty{padding:40px;text-align:center;color:#71767e}
.empty b{display:block;font-family:Bahnschrift,"Archivo Narrow","Segoe UI",sans-serif;font-size:17px;
  color:#a3a8b0;margin-bottom:6px;text-transform:uppercase}

#toast{position:fixed;right:20px;bottom:20px;z-index:90;width:390px}
.tst{background:#1d1f24;border:1px solid #3d424a;border-left:3px solid #4fae7d;padding:11px 15px;
  margin-top:8px;font-size:13px;box-shadow:0 8px 26px rgba(0,0,0,.5)}
.tst.e{border-left-color:#dc7361}
.tst b{display:block;font-family:Bahnschrift,"Archivo Narrow","Segoe UI",sans-serif;font-size:12px;
  letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:3px}

#modal{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;background:rgba(8,9,11,.78);
  display:none;z-index:80;overflow:auto}
#modal.on{display:block}
.mw{background:#1d1f24;border:1px solid #3d424a;max-width:600px;width:92%;margin:40px auto;
  box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.6)}
.mw h3{font-family:Bahnschrift,"Archivo Narrow","Segoe UI",sans-serif;font-size:17px;text-transform:uppercase;
  letter-spacing:.04em;margin:0;padding:14px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid #31353c;background:#24272d}
.mb{padding:18px}
.mf{padding:13px 18px;border-top:1px solid #31353c;text-align:right;background:#111216}
.mf .btn{margin-left:10px}

.kv{font-size:13px}
.kv dt{float:left;clear:left;width:150px;padding-top:3px;font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:10px;
  letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#71767e}
.kv dd{margin:0 0 6px 164px}

/* ------------------------- JOB CARD ------------------------------- */
.jc-actions{margin-bottom:14px;text-align:right}
.jc-actions .btn{margin-left:10px}
.jobcard{background:#fff;color:#111;border:1px solid #3d424a;max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;
  padding:26px 30px;font-family:"Segoe UI",sans-serif}
.jc-hd{border-bottom:3px solid #f2b01e;padding-bottom:12px;margin-bottom:14px}
.jc-hd>div{float:left}
.jc-hd>.jc-to{float:right}
.jc-hd b{font-family:Bahnschrift,"Archivo Narrow","Segoe UI",sans-serif;font-size:16px;
  text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.03em}
.jc-to{text-align:right;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.6}
.jc-kv{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:16px}
.jc-kv td{border:1px solid #ccc;padding:6px 9px;vertical-align:top}
.jc-kv td:nth-child(1),.jc-kv td:nth-child(3){background:#f4f4f4;font-weight:600;width:150px}
.jc-cost{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px}
.jc-cost th{background:#1f3864;color:#fff;text-align:left;padding:7px 9px}
.jc-cost td{border:1px solid #ccc;padding:7px 9px}
.jc-cost .num{text-align:right}
.jc-tot td{font-weight:700;background:#fff2cc}

/* ------------------------- RESPONSIVE ----------------------------- */
@media(max-width:1200px){.src #srctext{display:none}}
@media(max-width:1000px){
  #login .art{display:none}
  #login .form{width:100%}
  #login .art h1{font-size:34px}
  nav{display:none}
  main{left:0}
}

@media print{
  .no-print,nav,header,.ph,#toast,.tst{display:none}
  body,#shell,main{background:#fff;position:static;overflow:visible}
  main{position:static;padding:0}
  .jobcard{border:none;max-width:none;padding:0;margin:0}
}

/* ==================================================================
   v6 COMPONENTS
   No var(), no flex, no grid, no gap — the .hta runs on the Windows IE
   engine, which drops those declarations silently. Floats, inline-block
   and tables only. The ietest linter fails the build if any slip in.
   ================================================================== */

/* --- two-up cards (replaces what would be a flex row) --- */
.split{margin:0 0 16px 0}
.card.half{float:left;width:49%;margin-right:2%;margin-bottom:0}
.card.half.last{margin-right:0}
.clr{clear:both;height:0;overflow:hidden;font-size:0;line-height:0}

/* --- pie --- */
.pie{float:left;width:196px;padding:2px 14px 0 0}
.pielg{float:left;width:52%;padding-top:6px}
.lg{padding:5px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #24272d;font-size:12.5px}
.lg i{display:inline-block;width:10px;height:10px;margin-right:8px;vertical-align:middle}
.lg .lgn{display:inline-block;width:44%;color:#a3a8b0;vertical-align:middle;
         overflow:hidden;white-space:nowrap;text-overflow:ellipsis}
.lg .lgv{display:inline-block;width:30%;text-align:right;color:#eae8e3;font-weight:600;vertical-align:middle}
.lg .lgp{display:inline-block;width:18%;text-align:right;color:#71767e;vertical-align:middle}

/* --- horizontal bars --- */
table.bars{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}
table.bars th{text-align:left;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.7px;color:#a3a8b0;
              font-weight:600;padding:7px 12px 7px 0;width:112px;white-space:nowrap}
table.bars td{padding:7px 0}
table.bars td.bv{width:58px;text-align:right;font-weight:700;color:#eae8e3;
                 padding-left:12px;font-size:14px}
.bw{display:block;height:15px;background:#24272d;border:1px solid #31353c;overflow:hidden}
.bw i{display:block;height:13px;font-size:0}

/* --- big single figures --- */
.big2{font-size:46px;font-weight:700;color:#f2b01e;line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-1px}
input.big{font-size:26px;font-weight:700;color:#f2b01e;padding:9px 11px}
input.tin{width:130px;text-align:right}

/* --- key / value tables inside cards --- */
table.kvt{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}
table.kvt td.k{padding:9px 0 2px 0;color:#a3a8b0;font-size:13.5px}
table.kvt td.v{padding:9px 0 2px 0;text-align:right;font-size:26px;font-weight:700;color:#eae8e3}
table.kvt td.s{padding:0 0 10px 0;color:#71767e;font-size:11.5px;border-bottom:1px solid #24272d}

/* --- totals block --- */
table.tot{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;background:#15161a;border:1px solid #31353c}
table.tot td{padding:9px 13px;font-size:14px}
table.tot td.k{color:#a3a8b0}
table.tot td.v{text-align:right;font-weight:700;color:#eae8e3}
table.tot tr.grand td{border-top:2px solid #f2b01e;font-size:20px;color:#f2b01e;padding-top:12px}
td.calc{color:#4fae7d;font-weight:700}

/* --- guidance text under a field (the manager's blue PPT text) --- */
.guide{display:block;color:#6c9cc6;font-size:11.5px;padding-top:4px;line-height:1.45}

/* --- warning / note panel --- */
.warn{background:#2e2614;border-left:3px solid #f2b01e;padding:11px 14px;color:#d9c9a8;
      font-size:12.5px;margin-top:16px;line-height:1.55}

/* --- brand-new-part entry grid --- */
table.np input{width:100%;background:#15161a;border:1px solid #31353c;color:#eae8e3;
               padding:6px 7px;font-family:inherit;font-size:12.5px}
table.np input:focus{border-color:#f2b01e;outline:none}
table.np td{padding:3px 4px}

/* --- print zone is invisible on screen --- */
#pz{display:none}

/* ==================================================================
   PRINT
   Three documents come out of this one file: the Finance assumptions
   sheet, the cost sheet and the invoice. The body carries a class
   saying which, everything on screen is hidden, and #pz is shown.
   ================================================================== */
@media print{
  html,body{background:#ffffff;color:#000000}
  body.pA #login,body.pA #shell,body.pA #modal,body.pA #toast,
  body.pC #login,body.pC #shell,body.pC #modal,body.pC #toast,
  body.pI #login,body.pI #shell,body.pI #modal,body.pI #toast{display:none}
  body.pA #pz,body.pC #pz,body.pI #pz{display:block;background:#ffffff;color:#000000;padding:0}

  #pz table.xl{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;
               font-family:Calibri,'Segoe UI',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px}
  #pz table.xl td,#pz table.xl th{border:1px solid #666666;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top}
  #pz .banner{background:#EFE93C;font-size:19px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;padding:7px}
  #pz .grn{background:#22B14C;color:#ffffff;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;font-size:14px}
  #pz .org{background:#E8A33D;font-weight:bold;text-align:center}
  #pz .rose{background:#E8B4B8;font-weight:bold}
  #pz .yel{background:#F5E93B}
  #pz .ltyel{background:#FAF4A0}
  #pz .ltblue{background:#CDE3F0;text-align:center}
  #pz .brown{background:#7A6B3A;color:#ffffff;font-weight:bold;font-size:14px}
  #pz .red{color:#C00000}
  #pz .r{text-align:right}
  #pz .c{text-align:center}
  #pz .b{font-weight:bold}
  #pz .muted{color:#777777}
  #pz .inputcell{background:#F5E93B;font-size:17px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center}
  #pz .docttl{font-size:17px;font-weight:bold;margin:0 0 3px 0;
              font-family:Calibri,Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000}
  #pz .docsub{font-size:11px;color:#444444;margin:0 0 11px 0;font-family:Calibri,Arial,sans-serif}
  #pz .fnote{font-size:10.5px;color:#444444;margin:9px 0 0 0;font-family:Calibri,Arial,sans-serif}
  #pz .sigrow{margin-top:30px;font-family:Calibri,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;width:100%}
  #pz .sigrow td{border:0;padding-top:26px}
  #pz .sigline{border-top:1px solid #000000;width:210px;padding-top:3px}

  /* Harness label images. One picture takes the page width, two share it,
     three or more tile at a third each, with heights capped so the block
     never pushes the signature line onto a second sheet. */
  #pz .shotcell{padding:8px!important;text-align:center;vertical-align:top}
  #pz .pshot{display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;margin:4px;text-align:center}
  #pz .pshot img{display:block;margin:0 auto;border:1px solid #999999}
  #pz .pshot.one{width:98%}
  #pz .pshot.two{width:47%}
  #pz .pshot.many{width:31%}
  #pz .pshot.one img{max-width:100%;max-height:120mm}
  #pz .pshot.two img{max-width:100%;max-height:78mm}
  #pz .pshot.many img{max-width:100%;max-height:52mm}
  #pz .pshotph{display:block;border:1px dashed #999999;padding:26px 10px;color:#777777;font-size:11px}
  #pz .imgblk{page-break-inside:avoid}
}

/* ==================================================================
   v7 COMPONENTS — password, date picker, column filters, images
   Still no var(), grid, flex or gap: the IE engine drops all four.
   ================================================================== */

/* --- sign-in --- */
.pwwho{padding:0 0 14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #31353c;margin-bottom:16px}
.pwwho .av{display:inline-block;width:38px;height:38px;line-height:38px;text-align:center;
           background:#f2b01e;color:#111216;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;
           margin-right:11px;vertical-align:middle}
.pwwho div{display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle}
.pwwho b{display:block;font-size:15px;color:#eae8e3}
.pwwho small{display:block;color:#71767e;font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:.7px;text-transform:uppercase}
.pwerr{display:none;background:#2c1a17;border-left:3px solid #dc7361;color:#e8a89c;
       padding:9px 12px;font-size:12.5px;margin-top:12px}

/* --- date field --- */
.dtwrap{display:block;position:relative}
.dtwrap input.dt{width:100%;padding-right:36px}
.dtbtn{position:absolute;right:1px;top:1px;width:32px;height:32px;line-height:0;
       background:transparent;border:0;color:#a3a8b0;cursor:pointer;padding:0}
.dtbtn:hover{color:#f2b01e}

/* --- calendar popup --- */
.cal{position:absolute;z-index:70;background:#1d1f24;border:1px solid #3d424a;
     box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.55);padding:9px;width:232px}
.calhd{padding:2px 2px 8px 2px;text-align:center;color:#eae8e3;font-size:13px}
.calhd b{display:inline-block;width:132px}
.calnav{background:#24272d;border:1px solid #3d424a;color:#eae8e3;width:26px;height:24px;
        cursor:pointer;font-size:14px;line-height:1;padding:0}
.calnav:hover{background:#31353c;border-color:#f2b01e}
table.calg{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%}
table.calg th{color:#71767e;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:600;padding:3px 0;text-align:center}
table.calg td{padding:1px;text-align:center}
.calday{width:28px;height:26px;background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;
        color:#c9cdd3;cursor:pointer;font-size:12.5px;padding:0}
.calday:hover{background:#31353c;color:#eae8e3}
.calday.tdy{border-color:#6c9cc6}
.calday.on{background:#f2b01e;color:#111216;font-weight:700}
.calft{border-top:1px solid #31353c;margin-top:7px;padding-top:7px;text-align:right}
.calx{background:#24272d;border:1px solid #3d424a;color:#a3a8b0;font-size:11.5px;
      padding:4px 9px;cursor:pointer;margin-left:5px}
.calx:hover{color:#eae8e3;border-color:#f2b01e}

/* --- per-column filter row --- */
tr.fltrow th,tr.fltrow td{padding:4px 5px!important;background:#1b1d22;
                          border-bottom:1px solid #31353c}
.fx{width:100%;background:#15161a;border:1px solid #31353c;color:#eae8e3;
    padding:4px 6px;font-family:inherit;font-size:11.5px}
.fx:focus{border-color:#f2b01e;outline:none}
select.fx{padding:3px 4px}

/* --- attached images --- */
.shots{padding-top:10px}
.shot{display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:120px;margin:0 10px 10px 0;
      position:relative;text-align:center}
.shot img{display:block;width:120px;height:82px;border:1px solid #3d424a;background:#15161a}
.shotph{display:block;width:118px;height:80px;border:1px dashed #3d424a;background:#15161a;
        color:#71767e;font-size:10.5px;padding:31px 0 0 0;overflow:hidden}
.shot em{display:block;font-style:normal;color:#71767e;font-size:10.5px;padding-top:4px;
         overflow:hidden;white-space:nowrap;text-overflow:ellipsis}
.shotx{position:absolute;top:-6px;right:-6px;width:20px;height:20px;line-height:18px;
       background:#dc7361;color:#fff;border:0;cursor:pointer;font-size:13px;padding:0}
.shotx:hover{background:#e88877}

/* ==================================================================
   v8 — save status, likely-person tag
   ================================================================== */
.savest{float:right;margin:15px 0 0 12px;padding:4px 10px 4px 9px;
        font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.4px;
        border:1px solid #31353c;background:#1b1d22;color:#a3a8b0;white-space:nowrap;cursor:default}
.savest i{display:inline-block;width:8px;height:8px;margin-right:7px;vertical-align:middle;
          background:#4fae7d}
.savest.busy i{background:#f2b01e}
.savest.busy{color:#eae8e3;border-color:#5a4a1a}
.savest.wait i{background:#d99b3c}
.savest.wait{color:#e6c48a;border-color:#5a4a1a;background:#241f14}
.pick button.likely{border-color:#f2b01e}
.pick button em.here{display:block;font-style:normal;color:#f2b01e;font-size:10.5px;
                     letter-spacing:.8px;text-transform:uppercase;padding-top:2px}

</style>
</head>
<body>
<div id="login">
  <div class="art">
    <div class="artin">
      <h1>Electrical Design<br>Systems Lab<em>Material Management</em></h1>
      <p>One place for engineers to check stock and raise a harness BOM, for the store to reserve and issue material, and for management to see where everything stands.</p>
      <div class="stats"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="form">
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="mk">EDS</div>
      <div><div class="t1">JCB India &middot; Pune &middot; Design Centre</div><div class="t2">Material Management</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="hz" style="margin:14px 0 6px"></div>
    <span class="lbl" id="picklbl">Open the portal as</span>
    <div id="roles"></div>
    <div id="who" style="display:none">
      <div class="idrow"><button class="idback" id="idback">&lsaquo; BACK TO ROLES</button></div>
      <div class="pick" id="pick"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="note" id="modeline"></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div id="shell">
  <header>
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="mk">EDS</div>
      <div><div class="t1">JCB India &middot; Pune</div><div class="t2">Material Management</div></div>
    </div>
    <span class="sp"></span>
    <div class="src" id="src" title="Where the data comes from">
      <span class="dot" id="srcdot"></span>
      <span id="srctext">&mdash;</span>
      <button class="hbtn" id="refresh">Refresh now</button>
    </div>
    <span class="savest ok" id="savest" title=""><i></i>All saved</span>
    <button class="hbtn" id="reset">Reset demo</button>
    <button class="hbtn" id="logout">Sign out</button>
    <div class="who">
      <div class="av" id="whoAv">?</div>
      <div><b id="whoName"></b><span id="whoRole"></span></div>
    </div>
  </header>
  <nav id="nav"></nav>
  <main id="main"></main>
</div>

<div id="toast"></div>
<div id="modal"></div>

<!-- Print zone. Hidden on screen; the print stylesheet hides everything else
     and shows only this, so one .hta can print the assumptions sheet, the cost
     sheet and the invoice without ever opening a second window. -->
<div id="pz"></div>

